-- src:40008 | (c) the issuer;
-- src:40010 | (d) a director or an equivalent person, or a proposed director or
-- src:40011 | an equivalent person, of the issuer;
-- src:40013 | (da) a person named in the prospectus with the person’s consent
-- src:40014 | as an underwriter to the issue or sale;
-- src:40016 | (e) a person named in the prospectus as a stockbroker to the
-- src:40017 | issue or sale if the person participates in any way in the
